From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Electron contributors <electron@github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 11:00:00 +0800
Subject: feat: scope native popup appearance to individual menu trees

Let embedders style a Views popup and its submenus without mutating the
process-wide MenuConfig. Preserve the existing layout when no appearance
is present. Inline child controls continue using the native menu runner.

